Package: libharfbuzz0b
Version: @DEB_HARFBUZZ_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Depends: libfreetype6, libglib2.0-0, libgraphite2-3
Section: Libraries
Priority: standard
Multi-Arch: foreign
Description: OpenType text shaping engine (shared library)
 HarfBuzz is an implementation of the OpenType Layout engine. This build is
 meson-built with every backend enabled: freetype, ICU, glib, gobject,
 graphite2 and CoreText.
 .
 The package name shadows Procursus harfbuzz 2.8.1, so it is deliberately a
 strict superset of that library's exports. Disabling a backend here breaks
 consumers linked against the Procursus build: libgtk-4.1.dylib binds
 _hb_glib_script_to_script out of libharfbuzz.0.dylib, and the glib-less
 10.2.0+ios1 build took down every GTK4 app on device.
 .
 This package contains the core shared library (libharfbuzz.0.dylib).
